b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝天宫观方道士所画三山图三首 其二","author":"袁凯","text":"巨鱼出没浪波腥，东望三山路杳冥。\n安得秦皇射蛟手，为操强弩下沧溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝天宫观方道士所画三山图三首 其三","author":"袁凯","text":"方壶少小学为仙，笔底三山岂偶然。\n见说麻姑头总白，不知何用得长年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬州逢李十二衍二首 其一","author":"袁凯","text":"与子相逢俱少年，东吴城郭酒如川。\n如今白发知多少，风雨扬州共被眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬州逢李十二衍二首 其二","author":"袁凯","text":"最忆东家《水调》声，花前檀板杂流莺。\n此时我醉君犹醒，舞到梧桐白露生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过黄渡有感","author":"袁凯","text":"马家宅畔无乔木，徐氏门前芳草多。\n留得白头渔父在，年年长笛送沧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮西夜坐","author":"袁凯","text":"萧萧风雨满关河，酒尽西楼听雁过。\n莫怪行人白头尽，异乡秋色不胜多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李陵泣别图","author":"袁凯","text":"上林木落雁南飞，万里萧条使节归。\n犹有交情两行泪，西风吹上汉臣衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中夜坐","author":"袁凯","text":"落叶萧萧淮水长，故园归路更微茫。\n一声新雁三更雨，何处行人不断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城西送邓生","author":"袁凯","text":"千山风雪正霏霏，君去金陵几日归。\n凤凰台上还吹笛，东望沧溟泪满衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜至瓜洲","author":"袁凯","text":"瓜洲人家灯火微，瓜洲波上行人稀。\n敲门买得双清酒，船在西陵逆浪归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄三江王六秀才","author":"袁凯","text":"沧洲荷屋晚秋时，橘柚青黄满户垂。\n安得扁舟趁潮去，醉看江雨散轻丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调郑老","author":"袁凯","text":"郑老曾为前代官，江湖相见独饥寒。\n不道夜深霜露重，犹将玉笛倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑老归襄阳","author":"袁凯","text":"我爱襄阳老郑虔，高楼吹笛动秋烟。\n他时若有平安信，即寄江东估客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮东逢张十二信","author":"袁凯","text":"少年追逐共西东，吴迈文章马亮弓。\n一自干戈零落尽，白头淮海独相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观沙鸥","author":"袁凯","text":"门外群鸥我所知，终朝相见不相离。\n借尔桥东杨柳岸，明年春日更添儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上寄严八","author":"袁凯","text":"一春不见严夫子，底事城中不肯还？\n门外白鸥三万个，几时相对绿波间？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上寄书","author":"袁凯","text":"湘南估客发西津，东入姑苏花正春。\n独有相思数行字，欲从江海问情人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉书壁","author":"袁凯","text":"芙蓉花开满高岸，还如杜老蜀江边。\n田夫野客频来看，白酒黄鸡不用钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆南湖二首 其一","author":"袁凯","text":"我忆南湖春酒香，百钱亦可解愁肠。\n湖头白藕犹堪爱，正似佳人玉臂长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4c