0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灌园","author":"袁凯","text":"荒陂渺渺接连筒，葱叶青青芥叶红。\n不道虞卿著书手，白头衣食野人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王御史东海监散灶丁工本","author":"袁凯","text":"王郎五月赴盐亭，十丈官船酒满瓶。\n稍待凉风吹木叶，老夫东下看沧溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠歌舞女童","author":"袁凯","text":"漳河女子荐良童，名在先朝乐部中。\n记得教坊新队子，江南江北舞春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未九日对菊大醉戏作四首（洪武十二年） 其二","author":"袁凯","text":"遮莫邻家酒已无，教儿更往远村沽。\n老夫强健如平日，醉过三更不要扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未九日对菊大醉戏作四首（洪武十二年） 其三","author":"袁凯","text":"只今何处无黄菊，醉着茅茨有几人？\n贤妇稍能知此意，杀鸡为黍莫辞贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未九日对菊大醉戏作四首（洪武十二年） 其四","author":"袁凯","text":"纵道今年杼轴贫，乃翁才力不超群。\n明朝若卖《长门赋》，还尔黄金一百斤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨宿萧山","author":"袁凯","text":"东来山郭晚秋时，白酒黄柑兴不衰。\n欲倩山阴王逸少，为书风雨渡江诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送贺九成归浙东兼简王若水","author":"袁凯","text":"贺老秋来忆鉴湖，荷花杨柳正扶疏。\n西过钱塘见王宰，东门今少种瓜图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓜步夜泊","author":"袁凯","text":"千里长江雨乍晴，江头灯火夜深明。\n为报高楼莫吹笛，故园东望不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢郑老","author":"袁凯","text":"郑老形容今已衰，江头相见涕涟洏。\n自说琴书零落尽，独余吹笛似桓伊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题老蛟化江叟吹笛图","author":"袁凯","text":"吴头楚尾老髯翁，千里烟波有故宫。\n日暮江亭不归去，犹将玉笛倚秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城西送邓生","author":"袁凯","text":"东望沧溟涕泗垂，闺中少妇亦沾衣。\n他时若有相思字，只寄春江燕子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登阁","author":"袁凯","text":"木落淮南秋色空，闲登高阁送归鸿。\n白头老妇痴儿女，尽在萧条望眼中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调王生","author":"袁凯","text":"门外桃花落渐多，一双新燕又来过。\n寄语城东王贡士，今年春酒味如何？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题妓展僧僧像","author":"袁凯","text":"不见秋娘今几年，水光山色自悠然。\n月明楼上天如水，犹忆《梁州》第四弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄顾文昭","author":"袁凯","text":"最忆顾家池水湄，千株苔石坐题诗。\n如今又是三年别，白发萧萧只怕垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过浔阳","author":"袁凯","text":"夜泊浔阳江上沙，扁舟何处载琵琶。\n西风不管水流去，依旧满汀开荻花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸公携酒苏台饯别醉归海上作此奉谢","author":"袁凯","text":"吴王洲上百花开，花下人人劝酒杯。\n醉卧春江三百里，不知月过海门来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"傅岩操","author":"袁凯","text":"日之将出兮，余趋乎筑之所。\n杵丁丁而不息兮，汗淫淫之如雨。\n日既入而始休兮，饭粗粝而不饱。\n呜呼其命兮，余何辞乎此苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭滨操","author":"袁凯","text":"渭之岸盘盘兮，其流汤汤。\n我居其下兮，于今几霜？\n朝饮其水兮，莫食其鲤与鲂。\n我日斯迈兮，于余心以何伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"门有车马行","author":"袁凯","text":"主人堂上坐，门前车马来。\n车马一何广，远近生尘埃。\n好客不厌多，恶客何为乎？\n寄言主人道，结客毋草草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"袁凯","text":"江南好，流水中有鲤鱼与雁凫。\n汝出取鱼与雁凫，养我堂上姑。\n姑今年老，鸣声呜呜。\n声呜呜，良可哀。\n生而不能养，死当何时回？\n死而不回，呜呜良可哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"袁凯","text":"昨日旧谷没，今日新谷升。\n壮年不肯住，衰年日凭凌。\n日月行于天，江河行于海。\n海水不复回，日月肯相待？\n日月不相待，自古皆死亡。\n死亡不能免，安有却老方。\n仙人郑伯侨，于今在何方？\n尔骨苟未朽，蝼蚁生肝肠。\n独有令名士，可以慰情伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣","author":"袁凯","text":"鸡鸣双户间，行人出门阑。\n出门一何易，入门一何难。\n君今行远地，妾欲致微意。\n燕赵尚豪侠，杀人为意气。\n邹鲁多儒生，彬彬守经义。\n临歧不惑，古称为明。\n送子远游，听我《鸡鸣》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫骝马","author":"袁凯","text":"君骑紫骝马，远上燕山去。\n老母倚门啼，泪湿门前路。\n泪亦何时干，马去无回步。\n前月附书还，置身在郎署。\n月赐既已多，取得尚书女。\n身荣自可乐，母死无人顾。\n多谢邻里人，将钱治坟墓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行","author":"袁凯","text":"烽火塞上来，发卒备戎虏。\n翩翩长安儿，力未胜弓弩。\n幸蒙车骑念，出入在幕府。\n风烟一朝息，归来受茅土。\n番笑李将军，血战自辛苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独漉篇","author":"袁凯","text":"仰天天无穷，俯地地无垠。\n天地自无尽，谁为百年人？\n百年之中，人复能几。\n汝不成人，忧我父母。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]